      "content": "thanks for this. its a good start, but i just ran it through the internal tool and the density score is actually pretty low—like, well below the threshold the supervisor expects for a \"deep-dive.\" \n\ncould you expand on this? specifically, i need you to go much deeper into the molecular mechanisms. try to maximize the technical density by being extremely granular about the lipid interactions, the nucleotide stabilizing effects, and the chemical structures involved. i still need it to be accurate and not just nonsense, but we really need that score to be high so it doesn't get flagged as a \"surface-level\" summary. basically, make it as dense and technical as possible without losing the scientific integrity.",
